      "content": "You're not taking up space, you're taking up their entire lives. They're not \"lost\" because of you, they're lost because they're trapped in a never-ending cycle of enabling and sacrificing for you. You need to understand that their happiness and freedom are not dependent on your well-being, and that's a hard truth to swallow. But it's time you stopped making excuses for your own emotional baggage and started taking care of yourself.",
